    "contents" : "---\ntitle: \"Comparison of temperature data sets)\"\noutput:\n  html_document:\n    css: SI-md-08.css\n    fig_caption: yes\n    highlight: haddock\n    number_sections: yes\n    theme: united\n    toc: yes\n    toc_float: false\n    collapsed: no\n---\n```{r smooth-curve, echo=FALSE}\noptions(width = 105)\nknitr::opts_chunk$set(dev='png', dpi=300, cache=FALSE)\npdf.options(useDingbats = TRUE)\n```\n\n# Introduction #\n\nThe two choices for global tempeature are the PAGES2k synthesis, and Mann et al. (2005) gridded (5-deg) reconstructions.\n\n```{r, results=\"hide\"}\n# read data\ndatapath <- \"e:/Projects/GPWG/work/feedback/data/sources/\"\ndatafile <- \"Mann-and-PAGES2k_tave.csv\"\ntave <- read.csv(paste(datapath, datafile, sep=\"\"))\nattach(tave)\n```\n```{r}\nhead(tave); tail(tave)\n```\n\n# Basic plots #\n\n```{r}\n# plot the two series\nxmin <- 500; xmax <- 2020; ymin <- -1.5; ymax <- 2.5; xminortick <- 50\nplot(NULL, NULL, type=\"n\", ylab=\"temperature anomalies\", xlim=c(xmin, xmax), ylim=c(ymin, ymax))\nlines(YearCE, PAGES2k, col=\"red\")\nlines(YearCE, Mann_globe_land, col=\"blue\")\naxis(side = 1, at = seq(xmin, xmax, by = xminortick*5), labels = FALSE, tck=1.0, fg=\"gray70\")\naxis(side = 1, at = seq(xmin-xminortick, xmax+xminortick, by = xminortick), labels = FALSE, tcl = -.25)\naxis(side = 1, at = seq(xmin, xmax, by = xminortick*5), labels = FALSE, tcl = -.5) \nlegend(\"topleft\", c(\"PAGES2k\",\"Mann_globe_land\"), lwd=1, col=c(\"red\",\"blue\"))\n\n```\n```{r, fig.asp=1, fig.width=5}\nplot(NULL, NULL, xlim=c(ymin, ymax), ylim=c(ymin, ymax), xlab=\"PAGES2k\", ylab=\"Mann_globe_land\")\npoints(PAGES2k, Mann_globe_land, pch=16, cex=0.6, col=\"gray60\")\npoints(PAGES2k[YearCE < 900], Mann_globe_land[YearCE < 900], pch=16, cex=0.6, col=\"purple\")\npoints(PAGES2k[YearCE > 2000], Mann_globe_land[YearCE > 2000], pch=16, cex=0.6, col=\"red\")\nlegend(\"topleft\", c(\"before 900 CE\",\"after 2000 CE\"), pch=16, cex=0.6, col=c(\"purple\",\"red\"))\ndetach(tave)\n```\n\n# Summary #",
